- `src/parse/netif.rs::tests::prop_netns_link_parse_never_panics` (the `net:[N]` parser on arbitrary bytes).

## Cross-cutting
- Errors: `enumerate` fails only if `root.sys/class/net` cannot be listed; `read_netns_ino` returns `Parse { file: "/proc/self/ns/net", what: "link" }` on a bad link.
- Validity: `Valid`, `Missing`, `Restricted`, `Failed` for the state.
- Accessibility: N/A
