## Context
ADR-016 allows one cache of at most 128 open `smaps_rollup` fds, for `Demand.detail_keys` only, so PSS and USS for visible rows (up to 512 keys, ADR-008) do not cost an `open` per second each. Entries are dropped when the key leaves demand or the identity check fails. E05's `proc/smaps.rs` owns the reading and the identity check; this bead is only the container. Sources: ADR-016 (file descriptor policy), ADR-008 (`detail_keys`, max 512), ADR-003 (`ProcessKey`).

