## Context
The contract between `TlTreeTable` and the five table owners (Processes, History, Services, Startup Apps, Connections) plus the fixed-column tables (Properties tabs, Handle Search). The delegate supplies finished rows (already sorted and filtered by the engine) by identity; the table only reports gestures back. This bead writes the trait and the row types at the top of `table/tree_table.rs`; E18-006 adds the entity in the same file. Sources: UI-PRC-001 (delegate trait, verbatim shape), UI-PRC-002 (row kinds, flags), UI-PRC-003 (Name cell parts), ADR-009 (`TableRow`, identity), D-011, R-075 (reused by every table), R-105.

## Deliverable
`crates/tl-ui/src/table/tree_table.rs` (create; `pub mod tree_table;` in `table/mod.rs`), types only:
```rust
pub trait TreeTableDelegate: 'static + Sized {
    type RowId: Copy + Eq + Hash + 'static;          // identity, never an index
    fn row_count(&self) -> usize;
    fn row_id(&self, ix: usize) -> Self::RowId;
    fn row_index(&self, id: Self::RowId) -> Option<usize>;   // FxHashMap, rebuilt per table version
    fn row_kind(&self, ix: usize) -> RowKind;
    fn row_depth(&self, ix: usize) -> u8;
    fn row_expandable(&self, ix: usize) -> Option<bool>;      // None = no chevron, Some(expanded)
    fn row_flags(&self, ix: usize) -> RowFlags;
    fn table_version(&self) -> u64;                          // bumps when rows change; drives row_index and CellTextCache
    fn columns(&self) -> &ColumnLayout;
    fn column_spec(&self, id: ColumnId) -> &ColumnSpec;
    fn cell(&self, ix: usize, col: ColumnId, out: &mut CellOut);
    fn name_cell(&self, ix: usize) -> NameCell;
    fn header_total(&self, col: ColumnId, out: &mut CellOut) -> bool;   // false = no line 2
    fn sort(&self) -> SortSpec;
    fn selectable(&self, ix: usize) -> bool;                 // false for group headers
    fn context_menu(&mut self, targets: &[Self::RowId], clicked_col: ColumnId, menu: TlMenu,
                    window: &mut Window, cx: &mut Context<TlTreeTable<Self>>) -> TlMenu;
    fn on_toggle_expand(&mut self, id: Self::RowId, cx: &mut Context<TlTreeTable<Self>>);
    fn on_sort(&mut self, col: ColumnId, cx: &mut Context<TlTreeTable<Self>>);
    fn on_columns_changed(&mut self, layout: &ColumnLayout, cx: &mut Context<TlTreeTable<Self>>); // persist
    fn on_visible_range(&mut self, ids: &[Self::RowId], cx: &mut Context<TlTreeTable<Self>>);     // demand, max 512 ids
    fn on_activate(&mut self, id: Self::RowId, cx: &mut Context<TlTreeTable<Self>>);              // Enter / double-click
    fn row_tooltip(&self, ix: usize) -> Option<AnyView>;
    fn empty_text(&self) -> Option<SharedString>;                                                  // UI-PRC-024
    fn header_lines(&self) -> HeaderLines { HeaderLines::Two }
    fn columns_fixed(&self) -> bool { false }     // true: no picker, no header-menu items 2, 3 and 6; resize and sort still work
    fn guide_lines(&self) -> bool { false }       // processes.tree_guide_lines (PROC-017)
}

